  "plain": "About two weeks after Roswell, the 1947 event in New Mexico where, in UFO accounts, a craft is said to have crashed, Washington passed the National Security Act of 1947 and created the Air Force and the CIA at the same time. Jake Barber, a helicopter pilot who says he retrieved a UFO himself, puts the dates side by side for Michels, presenting it as what he was told. The point he draws is that the modern security state was born in the shadow of the crash. The Act itself sets up the new Air Force and the CIA; why it came then, it does not say."
